				<source>Warning, the online pdfs is not instantaneous. You immediately get the embed code, but it will not be usable immediately. Also the list of pdfs, and the prevention of publication for pdfs already online will not be updated during this period. Do not post several times the same pdf, and thank you for waiting at least 10 minutes before concluding that it did not worked.</source>
